ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Holaaa{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡La lluvia es requetefantástica!
Me dan unas ganas de cantar...

¿No va a parar en todo el día? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Tendré que pasarme la tarde
aburrida en casa.

IT:
Dici che pioverà tutto il giorno?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Uffa, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, sono bagnata
fradicia!

ES:
A ti tampoco te gusta la lluvia,
¿a que no, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}
No la soporto, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}All this rain is making me feel like
I'm totally circling the drain.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Make it stop, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}No sé ni para qué me molesto en
arreglarme los días de lluvia.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
¡Que pare ya, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Questa pioggia è più deprimente di
un disco dei "Pulcini di Campagna".{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Qualcuno la fermi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
This rain is soaking me to the core.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Really, it's got to stop sometime,
right, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

TRANSLATION:
Bu yağmur iliğime kadar işledi.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Bir yerde durması lazım artık, değil
mi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Mira, mira cómo me brilla la piel! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
¡Es el poder milagroso de la lluvia,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}I can't think of anything I hate
MORE than rain at night. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
It's super yucky, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Non c'è niente che odii di più
di una serata piovosa.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Che barba, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Gece yağmurundan DAHA çok nefret ettiğim
bir şey düşünemiyorum. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Çok iğrenç, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

IT:
Che noia 'sto tempo! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Almeno di
giorno la pioggia ha un suo perché.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ma di sera è una pizza, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Böyle gecelerde bütün gökyüzünü içesim
geliyor! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Sanki her yer {{TAG:0005:000E:0000}}
doluymuş gibi!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}How can rain just keep on falling?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Doesn't it have a bedtime,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Qué pesada es esta lluvia...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} 
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Podría darnos un descanso,
¿no, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ancora pioggia?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ma non si stanca mai il cielo di
tutta quest'acqua, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}You don't seem to let the rain get
to you, do you, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I wish I knew how to do that!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Es que a ti la lluvia no te pone
de mal humor, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Cuéntame cómo lo haces!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ma come? La pioggia non ti mette
di cattivo umore, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Come ci riesci? Beat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} te!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Rainy nights like this are the most
beautiful thing in the world!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It makes my heart simply swim!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Non c'è niente di meglio di
una notte piovosa come questa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mi viene un tuffo al cuore!
